# Menu record 23, CREDITOS / CREDITS -- the live coin-pricing table, which is the only
# screen that renders a country's own denominations (F11: sub_D69CC applies the country's
# coin preset from the seven-way table at D5D01).  The corpus ran two countries, so five
# of the seven sets of denomination strings had never been on screen.
#
# The page needs no credits and no ball: TEST opens the menu, scroll twice and select
# reaches record 3 (TECHNICAL, F14/F18's own path), then one scroll and select reaches
# record 23.  The country is set by a saved cfg, one per country -- see the README.
    40 tap 8 KEYCODE_1
  1400 mark open-menu
  1410 tap 12 KEYCODE_7
  1600 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
  1730 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
  1860 tap 12 KEYCODE_RSHIFT
  2100 mark svc-3-technical
  2200 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
  2400 tap 12 KEYCODE_RSHIFT
  2700 mark svc-23-credits
  3600 mark credits-settled
  5200 mark credits-held
  6400 mark end
